{"words": [{"text": "وَلَئِنْ", "translation": "And even if"}, {"text": "أَتَيْتَ", "translation": "you come"}, {"text": "ٱلَّذِينَ", "translation": "(to) those who"}, {"text": "أُوتُوا۟", "translation": "were given"}, {"text": "ٱلْكِتَـٰبَ", "translation": "the Book"}, {"text": "بِكُلِّ", "translation": "with all"}, {"text": "ءَايَةٍۢ", "translation": "(the) signs"}, {"text": "مَّا", "translation": "not"}, {"text": "تَبِعُوا۟", "translation": "they would follow"}, {"text": "قِبْلَتَكَ ۚ", "translation": "your direction of prayer"}, {"text": "وَمَآ", "translation": "and not"}, {"text": "أَنتَ", "translation": "(will) you (be)"}, {"text": "بِتَابِعٍۢ", "translation": "a follower"}, {"text": "قِبْلَتَهُمْ ۚ", "translation": "(of) their direction of prayer"}, {"text": "وَمَا", "translation": "And not"}, {"text": "بَعْضُهُم", "translation": "some of them"}, {"text": "بِتَابِعٍۢ", "translation": "(are) followers"}, {"text": "قِبْلَةَ", "translation": "(of the) direction of prayer"}, {"text": "بَعْضٍۢ ۚ", "translation": "(of each) other"}, {"text": "وَلَئِنِ", "translation": "And if"}, {"text": "ٱتَّبَعْتَ", "translation": "you followed"}, {"text": "أَهْوَآءَهُم", "translation": "their desires"}, {"text": "مِّنۢ", "translation": "from"}, {"text": "بَعْدِ", "translation": "after"}, {"text": "مَا", "translation": "[what]"}, {"text": "جَآءَكَ", "translation": "came to you"}, {"text": "مِنَ", "translation": "of"}, {"text": "ٱلْعِلْمِ ۙ", "translation": "the knowledge"}, {"text": "إِنَّكَ", "translation": "indeed, you"}, {"text": "إِذًۭا", "translation": "(would) then"}, {"text": "لَّمِنَ", "translation": "(be) surely among"}, {"text": "ٱلظَّـٰلِمِينَ", "translation": "the wrongdoers"}], "sahih": "And if you brought to those who were given the Scripture every sign, they would not follow your qiblah. Nor will you be a follower of their qiblah. Nor would they be followers of one another's qiblah. So if you were to follow their desires after what has come to you of knowledge, indeed, you would then be among the wrongdoers."}